@hostname = localhost
@port = 8301
@host = {{hostname}}:{{port}}
@token = replace-with-access-token

### AdminLogin
post http://{{host}}/api/admin/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### GetPostList
get http://{{host}}/api/post?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&keyword=测试 HTTP/1.1

### GetPostList (without keyword)
get http://{{host}}/api/post?pageNum=1&pageSize=3 HTTP/1.1

### GetDiscList
get http://{{host}}/api/disc?pageNum=1&pageSize=10 HTTP/1.1

### GetPostByID
@postId = 1
get http://{{host}}/api/post/{{postId}} HTTP/1.1

### CreatePost
post http://{{host}}/api/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "新文章标题",
  "content": "<p>新文章内容</p>"
}

### UpdatePost
put http://{{host}}/api/post/{{postId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的标题",
  "content": "更新后的内容"
}

### BatchDeletePosts
post http://{{host}}/api/post/delete HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

### GetVideoList
get http://{{host}}/api/video HTTP/1.1

### GetAdmin
@adminId = 1
get http://{{host}}/api/admin/{{adminId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### UpdateAdmin
put http://{{host}}/api/admin/{{adminId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "name": "管理员",
  "password": "new-password"
}

### BatchDeleteAdmins
delete http://{{host}}/api/admin/batch HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

### ToggleAdminStatus
put http://{{host}}/api/admin/{{adminId}}/status HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "active"
}

### 启动 Cloudflare IPv4 最低延迟优选（无请求体，后台生成 IP 文本及 Clash 配置，保存后按 upload_config_file_url/secret 上传）
post http://{{host}}/api/cloudflare/fast-ip HTTP/1.1

### 查询最近一次优选任务（idle/running/succeeded/failed）
get http://{{host}}/api/cloudflare/fast-ip HTTP/1.1

### 下载优选生成的 Clash 配置（任务 succeeded 后，默认输出路径）
get http://{{host}}/public/clash-kdd.yaml HTTP/1.1
